  "schema:name": "MC-ICP-MS mass-independent Ti isotope analyses of OREX samples.",
  "schema:description": "Here, we report the mass-independent Ti isotope composition of the five different aliquots of Bennu, OREX-800055-101, OREX-800117-110, OREX-803231-102 and OREX-800023-111. We also present data for the terrestrial sample BHVO-2, the carbonaceous chondrites Orgueil (CI), Aguas Zarcas (CM), Jbilet Winselwan (CM) & Tarda (C2-Ung), and the eucrite Pasamonte which were used to monitor data quality. Mass-independent isotope analyses were carried out at ETH Zurich (Switzerland) using a Neptune Plus MC-ICP-MS.",
  "schema:additionalType": [
    "Multi-Collector Inductively Coupled Plasma Mass Spectrometry",
    "ada:DataDeliveryPackage"
  ],
